Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without
modification, are permitted provided that the conditions stated in the
LICENSE file distributed with this project are met.

Author: Chengbo Du <cdu113@syr.edu>

Tabbed input panel for GDS workflows. Six modules:

    1. Space      - Geometry, conditioning status, program inputs
    2. Enclosure  - Aperture and door definition
    3. Service    - Program assembly, service hot water, thermal comfort
    4. HVAC       - HVAC system selection from templates
    5. Site       - Site, weather, PV, solar hot water
    6. Advanced   - Battery, wind, IDF injection and preview

Module outputs are written to named GH components on the canvas.
"""

